  "title": "Beer Batter Fish Made Great",
  "description": "These beer-battered fish fillets are seasoned with paprika and garlic, then deep-fried until crisp and golden brown for a crowd-pleasing dinner!",
  "authors": [
    "Linda Eberline"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-07T16:51:11-04:00",
